CHAPTER IV
RIGHTS OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
Article 5
The rights of victims and their families to obtain facilitation in the service process consist of/include:
a. The right to health recovery and the right to psychological recovery from the suffering experienced by the victim;
b. The right to legal assistance;
c. The right to obtain information;
d. The right to social recovery;
